        "kind": "quote",
        "text": "It was a landscape quiet in colour as Hangchow or bunjinga itself, but purely Japanese — not in the least like Tosa, but exactly reproducing the beautiful suburbs that were the city's pride. Arashiyama, Takano, Chionin, the valley of Tofukuji ; views of Lake Biwa",
